{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420065-multiple-target-withering-attacks","id":1420065,"title":"Multiple target withering attacks?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-24T20:13:52-07:00","id":1420065,"title":"Multiple target withering attacks?","content":"Hello all, I was asked a question about multiple target attacks by my players, and It got me wondering if there were any multiple target withering attacks as all the ones I knew about are for decisive attacks?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-24T20:20:42-07:00","id":1420066,"title":"","content":"Generally if you make one it's extremely expensive, and it only awards initiative for the highest damage inflicted, and one for each additional target hit. Solars and Lunars both have charms that function that way. Dragonblooded might as well, but I'm not 100% on that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T02:48:01-07:00","id":1420096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Citadel97501</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420065-multiple-target-withering-attacks#post1420065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello all, I was asked a question about multiple target attacks by my players, and It got me wondering if there were any multiple target withering attacks as all the ones I knew about are for decisive attacks?</div> </div> </div> </div>Circle of Bright Reaving is in the Corebook, Solar Melee page 353.<br /> <br /> NPCs (like the Armored Kraken) have similiar effects.<br /> <br /> Generally, DrLoveMonkey is correct: Circle of Bright Reaving is an Essence 5 Solar Charm, this is THE most powerful multi-target withering Charm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}